      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    net_income = 2_500_000\n    basic_shares = 300_000\n    options = 30_000\n    exercise_price = 20\n    average_market_price = 30\n\n    # Calculate incremental shares using the treasury stock method\n    exercise_proceeds = options * exercise_price\n    repurchased_shares = exercise_proceeds / average_market_price\n    incremental_shares = options - repurchased_shares\n    diluted_shares = basic_shares + incremental_shares\n\n    # Calculate diluted EPS and round to the closest cent\n    answer = round(net_income / diluted_shares, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
